      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "value": "<ol>\n<li>Record of the sum of the repairs</li>\n<li>made in the large \u1e6dabaqa,</li>\n<li>Shirkat al-Dayy\u0101n R. Menash\u0113, may God preserve him, (being)</li>\n<li>the apartment of his son, al-Shaykh Joseph:</li>\n<li>The first day, that is, Thursday, 15</li>\n<li>Iyyar: Clay, 2. Gypsum, 2.</li>\n<li>Gypsum, 12&frac14; \u2153. A layer of clay pipes, &frac34;.</li>\n<li>A meal, 1&frac14;. Helpers, 2&frac14;. A special mason, 2&frac14;</li>\n<li>Supervision, 1. A water carrier, 1&frac12;.</li>\n<li>Friday &hellip;.</li>\n<li>Gypsum, 6. Water, 2. A meal, 1&frac14;, A special mason, 5.</li>\n<li>Helpers, 4&frac12;. Pillars, 1. A layer of clay pipes, &frac14;.</li>\n<li>A carpenter, &frac34;. Sunday:</li>\n<li>Gypsum, 9. A gift, &frac14; + \u2153. 2 special masons, 4.</li>\n<li>Helpers, 5. A water carrier, 1&frac12;. Clay, 1. A meal, 1&frac14;.</li>\n<li>Total, 68&frac14;.</li>\n<li>Monday, the following day, sawyers, 11.</li>\n<li>&hellip;. N\u0101sh\u016bsh and transportation, 16&frac12;.&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>\n<li>&hellip;. Tuesday,</li>\n<li>&hellip;. a carpenter, 4. A helper, 2&frac12;. </li>\n</ol>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
